msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "Your clumsy moments come rushing to mind!"
msgstr "¡Me vienen a la mente tus momentos torpes!"

msgid "You saved me at the school pool"
msgstr "Me salvaste en la piscina escolar"

msgid "You won Miss Oohashi at the Culture Festival"
msgstr "Ganaste Miss Oohashi en el Festival Cultural"

msgid "About Kushieda"
msgstr "Sobre Kushieda"

msgid "She was always a ridiculous drinker"
msgstr "Siempre fue una bebedora tremenda"

msgid "She was always a ridiculous horror fan"
msgstr "Siempre fue tremenda fan del terror"

msgid "She was always ridiculously stubborn"
msgstr "Siempre fue tremendamente terca"

msgid "About Kitamura"
msgstr "Sobre Kitamura"

msgid "Did you enjoy your date yesterday?"
msgstr "¿Disfrutaste tu cita de ayer?"

msgid "I heard about when Kitamura confessed"
msgstr "Me enteré de cuando Kitamura se declaró"

msgid "What's so great about Kitamura?"
msgstr "¿Qué tiene de genial Kitamura?"

msgid "About Christmas"
msgstr "Sobre la Navidad"

msgid "I want to meet Angel Taiga-sama again"
msgstr "Quiero volver a ver a Ángel Taiga-sama"

msgid "I didn't get you a present!"
msgstr "¡No te di un regalo!"

msgid "You sang with Kawashima at the party"
msgstr "Cantaste con Kawashima en la fiesta"

msgid "About Food"
msgstr "Sobre la comida"

msgid "The first food I made you was fried rice"
msgstr "Lo primero que te cociné fue arroz frito"

msgid "Mizutaki with chicken dumplings tonight"
msgstr "Hoy toca mizutaki con albóndigas de pollo"

msgid "I'll teach you about cooking anytime"
msgstr "Te enseño a cocinar cuando quieras"

msgid "--Let's Ask Taiga!--"
msgstr "--¡Preguntémosle a Taiga!--"

msgid "Ryuuji「......W-Well, do your best.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......B-Bueno, esfuérzate.」"

msgid "Taiga「Too stifling!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Qué agobiante!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, sorry! ......Did that really affect＿her?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡A-Ah, perdón! ......¿De＿verdad le afectó?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Aargh, I bet you're silently laughing＿at my clumsiness, aren't you? I told＿you I'm fine on my own!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Aagh, seguro te estás riendo＿en silencio de mi torpeza, ¿verdad?＿¡Te dije que estoy bien sola!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I didn't say anything!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Yo no dije nada!」"

msgid "Taiga「Eyes are the windows to the soul!＿Hmph!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Los ojos son el espejo del alma! ¡Jum!」"

msgid "Taiga「Cold!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Qué frío!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「M-My bad...... Did that really affect her?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「C-Culpa mía...... ¿De verdad le afectó?」"

msgid "Taiga「What? Ran out of things to ask? Well, I＿guess your brain can't hold too many＿at once. Are we done here?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¿Se te acabaron las preguntas?＿Bueno, tu cerebro no retiene muchas＿a la vez. ¿Ya terminamos aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「H-Hang on. Uhh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Espera. Ehm......」"

msgid "Taiga「Waste of time! MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Pérdida de tiempo! ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh!? Uh, er, sorry. Let's see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿A-Ah?! Eh, perdón. Veamos......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugggh, you've even forgotten how to＿talk.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Agggh, hasta olvidaste cómo hablar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Look, can you not be a total monster＿right now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ¿puedes no portarte como＿un monstruo ahora mismo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, so you CAN talk. In that case, don't＿just stand there, half-wit.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, así que SÍ sabes hablar. Entonces＿no te quedes ahí parado, tonto.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you're done, can you be on your＿way?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si ya terminaste, ¿puedes＿seguir tu camino?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where'd you get that idea? I never said＿that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De dónde sacaste esa idea?＿Nunca dije eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Well, I don't really care.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, la verdad me da igual.」"

msgid "Taiga「......What, are you holding back? That's＿not like you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué, te estás conteniendo?＿Eso no es propio de ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's not it...... Wait. First, what do＿you mean \"not like me\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no es eso...... Espera. Primero,＿¿qué quieres decir con \"propio de mí\"?」"

msgid "Taiga「Whining about the small details like＿that is TOTALLY your style.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Quejarte de pequeñeces como esa＿es TOTALMENTE tu estilo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Whatever.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Como sea.」"

msgid "Taiga「Everyone has a dark past!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Todos tienen un pasado oscuro!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, now you're defiant.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ahora te pones desafiante.」"

msgid "Taiga「Admit it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Admítelo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, is that so!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ah, sí?!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's a fact!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Es un hecho!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Well, it sounds like your memories＿are coming back to you properly.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, parece que tus recuerdos＿están volviendo como deben.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then I remembered correctly?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Entonces lo recordé bien?」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to confirm every little＿thing with me...... *Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tienes que confirmar cada detalle＿conmigo...... *Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Taiga「And then you happily followed me＿around, wagging your tail. Not that I let＿you anymore.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Y luego me seguías feliz a todas＿partes, moviendo la cola. Aunque＿ya no te dejo hacerlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......W-Well, it's better to be graceful＿than clumsy. Yep.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......B-Bueno, es mejor tener＿gracia que ser torpe. Sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Jeez...... In the first place, do you even＿remember how it happened?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cielos...... Para empezar, ¿siquiera＿recuerdas cómo pasó?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This conversation took a turn for the＿violent......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esta conversación se volvió＿violenta......」"

msgid "Taiga「STOOOOOP! Don't say any more!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡ALTOOOOO! ¡¡No digas nada más!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh!? Something bad happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿A-Ah?! ¿Pasó algo malo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「C-Calm down, Taiga! Your head's＿leaking!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡C-Cálmate, Taiga! ¡Tienes＿una fuga en la cabeza!」"

msgid "Taiga「What did you want, the kiss of life?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué querías, respiración boca a boca?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha -- you -- w-what the!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Q-Qué-- tú-- p-pero qué?!」"

msgid "Taiga「*Sigh*～ What are you getting all＿freaked out for? Obviously I'd refuse＿to.」"
msgstr "Taiga「*Suspiro*～ ¿Por qué te alteras＿tanto? Obviamente me negaría.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's all?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eso es todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? \"That's all\"......? What do you＿mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿\"Eso es todo\"......?＿¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing. It's fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada. No importa.」"

msgid "Taiga「I was just doing my duty as your owner.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo cumplía mi deber como tu dueña.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry about that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón por eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Indeed.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así es.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why would you get upset about that?＿Aren't you honored?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te molestas por eso?＿¿No te sientes honrada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So that's why. Makes sense.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que era por eso. Tiene sentido.」"

msgid "Taiga「What the hell!? Kissing up to me!?＿Don't remind me of stuff like that!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué demonios?! ¡¿Me estás adulando?!＿¡¡No me recuerdes esas cosas!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Ohh, that's right. Your old man＿was a no-show in the end......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Ahh, es cierto. Tu padre＿al final no apareció......」"

msgid "Taiga「SHUT UP! You make me sick!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡CÁLLATE! ¡¡Me das asco!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Felt like you were trying to deny＿something just then. Was it my＿imagination?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sentí que intentabas negar algo hace＿un momento. ¿Fue imaginación mía?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「J-Just your imagination.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「S-Solo fue tu imaginación.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't find fault in other people's＿preferences!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No critiques los gustos de los demás!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No lo hago.」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you gonna do if I confirm＿that? Make a full-course meal of＿nothing but super spicy food?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué vas a hacer si lo confirmo?＿¿Preparar un menú completo solo＿de comida superpicante?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, if I was gonna make food for＿someone, I'd use my normal recipes.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, si le cocinara a alguien,＿usaría mis recetas normales.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, at StuChi's villa, you got carried＿away making the curry......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, en la villa de StuChi te dejaste＿llevar haciendo el curry......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That was a pretty awful experience for＿you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Fue una experiencia bastante＿terrible para ti.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, it was awful.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, fue terrible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I think it would be agony going in＿and near-death coming out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, creo que sería agonía al entrar＿y casi la muerte al salir.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I don't really want to picture that.＿Alright, I'll hide it somewhere that＿Minorin won't find it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......No quiero imaginarme eso.＿Bien, la esconderé donde Minorin＿no la encuentre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that would be for the best.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, sería lo mejor.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's one of those \"love-hate\" things.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es una de esas cosas de \"amor y odio\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga, just so you know, that doesn't＿mean what you think it means.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Taiga, por si acaso, eso＿no significa lo que crees.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up. Anyway, Minorin likes the＿scary stuff.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate. En fin, a Minorin le＿gustan las cosas de miedo.」"

msgid "Taiga「\"Reverse psychology,\" she said. She＿got us good, too. That's my Minorin.」"
msgstr "Taiga「\"Psicología inversa\", dijo. También nos＿engañó bien. Así es mi Minorin.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why is it making you turn red?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te estás sonrojando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I thought it was almost entirely your＿idea...... Must be mis-remembering.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pensé que había sido casi todo idea＿tuya...... Debo estar recordando mal.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you remember, then why don't you＿use it for material in the next test of＿courage?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si lo recuerdas, ¿por qué no＿lo usas como base para la próxima＿prueba de valor?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not happening in the middle of＿winter.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no va a pasar en pleno invierno.」"

msgid "Taiga「You could run a haunted house at the＿next Culture Festival.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Podrías hacer una casa embrujada en＿el próximo Festival Cultural.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come to think of it, she get a＿nosebleed from all the excitement,＿huh. She took Kitamura hostage.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora que lo pienso, le sangró＿la nariz de la emoción, ¿eh? Tomó＿a Kitamura de rehén.」"

msgid "Taiga「And then took him to a m-moog--＿MORGUE. Oh, the poor thing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Y luego lo llevó a una m-mog--＿MORGUE. Ay, pobrecito.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not at all something to pity＿someone for.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no es para nada motivo para＿compadecerse de alguien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I didn't mean stubborn in a bad way.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No dije terca en mal sentido.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't say things that could be＿misinterpreted then!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Entonces no digas cosas que＿puedan malinterpretarse!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I get it. I'll be careful.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, entendido. Tendré cuidado.」"

msgid "Taiga「No Vocab Half-wit of the Year!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Tonto Sin Vocabulario del Año!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Speak for yourself...... No, sorry, I＿take that back!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「H-Habla por ti...... No,＿perdón, ¡lo retiro!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you flipping out?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te alteras así?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, my mistake!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, error mío!」"

msgid "Taiga「Why do you think I spent all that time＿with Kitamura-kun!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué crees que pasé todo ese＿tiempo con Kitamura-kun?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......F-For my sake......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿P-Por mi bien......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Obviously! So don't make fun of me!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Obvio! ¡¡Así que no te burles de mí!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón......」"

msgid "Taiga「Walking around together constitutes a＿date? What are you, 12?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Caminar juntos ya cuenta como una＿cita? ¿Qué tienes, 12 años?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not twelve......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No tengo doce......」"

msgid "Taiga「It'd be insulting to preteens if you＿were. You're on more of a fetus level.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sería insultar a los preadolescentes.＿Estás más bien a nivel de feto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm a little big for that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Estoy un poco grande para eso......」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, so you knew...... It wasn't a date or＿anything, but you insist on calling it＿that, hmmm......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, así que lo sabías...... No fue＿una cita ni nada, pero insistes en＿llamarlo así, mmmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing...... Nothing much.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada...... Nada importante.」"

msgid "Taiga「What? You know about it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¿Sabes sobre eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, it's more like, I heard it through＿the grapevine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, más bien me enteré por rumores.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I already did.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, ya se las di.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, that's good then.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, qué bien entonces.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, then let's drop it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, entonces dejemos el tema!」"

msgid "Taiga「Mistake of a lifetime!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡El error de tu vida!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoaa! ......Wait, what? I thought you＿were gonna hit me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Uaaah! ......Espera, ¿qué? Pensé＿que me ibas a golpear.」"

msgid "Taiga「I just imagined beating you to death＿108 times!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Acabo de imaginar que te molía a＿golpes hasta matarte 108 veces!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, the holy number...... My＿condolences......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, el número sagrado......＿Mis condolencias......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Guess it's in my best interests to go＿back the way I came.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que me conviene＿volver por donde vine.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you dare to enter, then I'm happy to＿give you the corresponding hospitality.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si te atreves a entrar, con gusto te＿daré la hospitalidad correspondiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Alright, back I go!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡B-Bien, media vuelta!」"

msgid "Taiga「Isn't he your best friend!?! Why would＿you ask that!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿No es tu mejor amigo?! ¡¿Por＿qué preguntarías eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, I didn't mean it like that. I meant,＿like, your favorite thing about him......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No, no lo decía así. Me refería a＿lo que más te gusta de él......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Yeah, you're right. You're exactly＿right! Sorry, slip of the tongue!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Sí, tienes razón. ¡Toda la＿razón! Perdón, ¡se me escapó!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Tch!」"

msgid "Taiga「Look forward to next time!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Espéralo con ansias la próxima vez!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You sound like a TV show.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Suenas como un programa de tele.」"

msgid "Taiga「She's right here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está justo aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... well, that's, yeah, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... bueno, pues sí, supongo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......That makes it sound like you don't＿like the normal me. You better have an＿excuse for this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Eso suena a que no te agrada＿mi yo normal. Más te vale tener＿una excusa para esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh. Sorry, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah. Perdón, perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, what's the date today?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, ¿qué fecha es hoy?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「January 4th.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「4 de enero.」"

msgid "Taiga「And when is Angel Taiga open for＿business?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y cuándo está en servicio Ángel Taiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Until Christmas.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hasta Navidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「Precisely.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Exactamente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait a second, no one said anything＿like that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera un segundo, nadie＿dijo nada parecido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're reading into it too much...... Just＿forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Le das demasiadas vueltas......＿Mejor olvídalo.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll still gladly accept one.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Igual lo aceptaré con gusto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, what would you like?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, ¿qué te gustaría?」"

msgid "Taiga「It doesn't have to be a physical object.＿Naturally, you'll let me decide whether＿I want to accept it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tiene que ser un objeto físico.＿Por supuesto, me dejarás decidir＿si quiero aceptarlo o no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh yeah, I said we'd have an＿outrageously luxurious feast for＿Christmas dinner. Let's do it next time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, sí, dije que tendríamos un＿banquete increíblemente lujoso en＿Navidad. Hagámoslo la próxima vez.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, you can still invite me over every＿now and then. I'll look forward to it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, igual puedes invitarme de vez en＿cuando. Lo esperaré con ganas.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yes you did!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sí me diste uno!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? What was it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah? ¿Y qué fue?」"

msgid "Taiga「Doesn't matter. You got me something!」"
msgstr "Taiga「No importa. ¡Me conseguiste algo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You just don't remember. As long as＿you're happy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Solo no te acuerdas. Con＿tal de que estés feliz.」"

msgid "Taiga「I wasn't really expecting you to.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tampoco es que esperara uno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That doesn't make it okay. Not after＿you gave me that nice suit.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no lo justifica. No después de＿que me diste ese traje tan bueno.」"

msgid "Taiga「Didn't I tell you I swiped it from my＿folks? Anyway, don't worry about it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No te dije que se lo robé a mis padres?＿En fin, no te preocupes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, come to think of it, you did......＿Well, as long as you're happy, it's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ahora que lo dices, sí......＿Bueno, si estás contenta, está bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「Basically, repay what you are given＿threefold.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Básicamente, devuelve lo que recibes＿multiplicado por tres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Uhhh, let's see...... Is it possible to＿repay in installments?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Ehhh, veamos......＿¿Se puede pagar a plazos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, that's right...... That's okay＿then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, es verdad......＿Entonces está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse me, but how did a conversation＿about you singing turn into THAT?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Disculpa, ¿pero cómo una charla sobre＿cuando cantaste terminó en ESO?」"

msgid "Taiga「Dunno!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ni idea!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's MY line...... Jeez.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esa es MI frase...... Cielos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha...... What's your problem? You're＿so nitpicky! Also, you meant＿\"pheromones,\" not \"hormones\"!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué...... qué te pasa? ¡Eres tan＿quisquillosa! Además, quisiste decir＿\"feromonas\", ¡no \"hormonas\"!」"

msgid "Taiga「SHUT UP!! Why'd you bring StuChi's＿name into this, then!? Screw you!＿Forget it!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡CÁLLATE!! ¡¿Para qué metiste a＿StuChi en esto, entonces?! ¡Al diablo＿contigo! ¡¡Olvídalo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, don't think I want part of this＿either! This conversation is over!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, ni creas que yo quiero seguir con＿esto! ¡Se acabó esta conversación!」"

msgid "Taiga「I did.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí canté.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's all you have to say?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eso es todo lo que vas a decir?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing more to it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No hay más que decir.」"

msgid "Taiga「Good lord, you remind me of the most＿pointless things.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Santo cielo, me haces recordar＿las cosas más absurdas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, come on. You know how I am. I＿thought you were amazing, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vamos, ya sabes cómo soy. Me pareció＿que estuviste increíble, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「......I see. Never mind then.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ya veo. No importa entonces.」"

msgid "Taiga「We were actually just lip-syncing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「En realidad solo hacíamos playback.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Seriously?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Taiga「Just kidding.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es broma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's hardly a compliment.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso apenas cuenta como un cumplido.」"

msgid "Taiga「I've come to realize that \"hunger is the＿best spice.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「Llegué a entender que \"el hambre＿es el mejor condimento\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just tell me it was delicious flat-out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo dime directamente que estuvo rico.」"

msgid "Taiga「It was delicious.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estuvo delicioso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That was pretty flat-out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eso fue bastante directo.」"

msgid "Taiga「The facts cannot be denied.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Los hechos no se pueden negar.」"

msgid "Taiga「So are you saying I should bring＿Minorin over for food?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Entonces dices que debería＿traer a Minorin a comer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, want to?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿quieres?」"

msgid "Taiga「Sadly not. Tonight I plan to play the＿role of perfect hostess at my place.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por desgracia, no. Hoy planeo ser la＿anfitriona perfecta en mi casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright. Well, kick some ass.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien. Pues dalo todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph. Don't tell me what to do.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum. No me digas qué hacer.」"

msgid "Taiga「H-Hmph! That's not enough to sway me＿from becoming self-reliant.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡J-Jum! Eso no basta para disuadirme＿de volverme independiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I see. Pardon me. I'm sure your＿shaking knees are just a figment of my＿imagination, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ya veo. Disculpa. Seguro que esas＿rodillas temblorosas son producto de＿mi imaginación, entonces.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's right. Maybe you should go get＿your eyes checked.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así es. Tal vez deberías ir＿a revisarte la vista.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I'll remember that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, lo tendré en cuenta.」"

msgid "Taiga「Bragging, are we?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Presumiendo, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm not trying to brag.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no intento presumir.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever. I don't see why you would＿tell me that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea. No veo por qué me dirías eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Make sure that Inko-chan doesn't find＿out.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Asegúrate de que Inko-chan no se entere.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, of course.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, por supuesto.」"

msgid "Taiga「I do think a basic learning structure is＿necessary, but do you really think I＿have the basics down?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí creo que hace falta una base＿para aprender, ¿pero de verdad crees＿que ya domino lo básico?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......? Hm? You're misplacing your＿anger there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......? ¿Mm? Estás descargando＿tu enojo donde no es.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I was only offering out of kindness......＿Oh, forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Yo solo me ofrecía por＿amabilidad...... Ah, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Taiga「That would be coddling me! I'm done＿with you, you hopeless, lazy,＿incompetent, useless human!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Eso sería consentirme! ¡¡Se acabó＿contigo, humano inútil, perezoso,＿incompetente y sin remedio!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You...... have no right to be angry＿here!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡T-Tú...... no tienes derecho＿a enojarte por esto!」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! I'm not going to bo-- bot--＿BOTHER you any further! Just you＿watch!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡No voy a mo-- mol--＿MOLESTARTE nunca más! ¡¡Ya lo verás!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Alright, I get it. I won't interfere.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bien, entiendo. No me meteré.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gee, thanks......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya, gracias......」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't intend to be spoiled.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No pienso dejar que me consientan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just think of it as going to a cooking＿class.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Piensa en ello como ir a＿una clase de cocina.」"

msgid "Taiga「I wouldn't mind that...... No, on second＿thought, I would.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso no me molestaría......＿No, pensándolo bien, sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's the problem?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Cuál es el problema?」"

msgid "Taiga「Sorry, but I refuse. Your skill is out of＿this world, and I just want to be＿normal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Lo siento, pero me niego. Tu habilidad＿es de otro mundo, y yo solo quiero＿ser normal.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Out of this world?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De otro mundo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Spectacularly out of this world. You＿could carve a phoenix out of a radish.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Espectacularmente de otro mundo. Hasta＿podrías tallar un fénix en un rábano.」"

